'''''Amidst the Mara-Struck''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Windswept Wanderlust]].

==Steps==
# Investigate the bizarre situation at the Xianzhou port
# Head to Starskiff Jetty with Tingyun
# Defeat enemies of unknown origins
# Take a starskiff to Central Starskiff Haven

