===Head to Starskiff Jetty with Tingyun{{subst:void|<!--102020107-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Cloudford|update|Upon arriving at the Xianzhou Luofu, only an empty port welcomes the Express.<br />Perhaps "empty" is not entirely accurate. Soulless mara-struck monsters are running rampant, and a delicate foxian girl is in danger. How can you let others have the glory of saving a damsel in distress?<br />It seems the only way to get any answers about the cause of the Luofu's chaotic situation is to leave this place with the foxian girl.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Welt:''' Get ready, and watch your backs.
:'''March 7th:''' Leave it to me!
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''March 7th:''' Why have we stopped?
:'''Tingyun:''' Don't worry, Miss. I have a favor to ask, that's all.
:'''March 7th:''' Favor...? Count me out. What if we do it wrong and you get your cloud cronies to throw us in jail.
:'''Tingyun:''' *sigh* I shouldn't have doubted you, please accept my apologies. Our road ahead is barricaded, do you see?
----
:'''Tingyun:''' The soldiers stationed here must have moved these into a roadblock.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's push them aside together?
::----
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm sure Mr. Yang could clear them out...
::----
::'''March 7th:''' What? Does he look like a crane to you?
:'''Tingyun:''' I'd like to see us try, haha... they're extremely heavy. Even with all of us, we wouldn't be able to move one.
:'''Tingyun:''' Not that I'm doubting your skill, but I'd feel terrible if you hurt yourself in the process.
:'''Tingyun:''' If I'm not mistaken, the containers in the Trove of Verdure can be moved around using a control panel.
:'''Tingyun:''' You've already put on quite the show &mdash; do you think you'll be able to find and operate the control panel? Should be simple, right?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Right!
::'''Tingyun:''' I knew it. This will be a breeze for you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Right! So why don't you do it?
::'''Tingyun:''' Oh, I'm afraid I'm not built for hard labor...
::'''March 7th:''' She sure knows how to boss people around.
----
:'''Tingyun:''' We just need to pass through here, take the barge to Starskiff Haven, and we'll be safe.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Defeat enemies of unknown origins{{subst:void|<!--102020108-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Cloudford|update|After rescuing Tingyun, the Amicassador of the Sky-Faring Commission, you go with her and attempt to find an escape vessel in Cloudford, which is currently overrun with mara-struck. However, strange enemies taking the form of twisted old branches block the way.<br />You will not be stopped here when a starskiff is just within reach!}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''March 7th:''' Y'know, you sound sweet enough, but you were talking about getting us escorted away by your Cloud Knights. If it weren't for Mr. Yang...
:'''Tingyun:''' You misunderstand. If you were in my shoes right now, wouldn't you want to keep your guard up~?
:'''March 7th:''' True... But we came here to trailblaze, not jailblaze.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Take a starskiff to Central Starskiff Haven{{subst:void|<!--102020109-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Cloudford|update|After rescuing Tingyun, the Amicassador of the Sky-Faring Commission, you go with her and attempt to find an escape vessel in Cloudford, which is currently overrun with the mara-struck. However, strange enemies taking the form of twisted old branches block the way.<br />After defeating the monsters of unknown origins, Tingyun personally takes the helm and steers you to a safe zone &mdash; Central Starskiff Haven.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Tingyun:''' *sigh* Finally. Look how many tail hairs I lost on the way. Oh, my beautiful tail...
:'''Tingyun:''' We had a difficult start, but things got easier. Look, that's the barge I was talking about.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Anyone... got a license for this thing?
::'''Tingyun:''' Don't fret. All Amicassadors know their way around a starskiff.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this... manual or automatic?
::'''Tingyun:''' Don't fret. All Amicassadors know their way around a starskiff.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Nice! I'm driving!
::'''Tingyun:''' Uh-uh. Just sit back, and relax. All Amicassadors know their way around a starskiff.
:'''March 7th:''' I was perfectly calm until she volunteered to help...
:'''Tingyun:''' Please take your seats, everyone. We'll be off right away.
----
;(Obtain {{Предмет|Undelivered Letter|20|x=1}})
